            <div xml:id="d611">

                <pb facs="0759" n="663" sameAs="frus:frus1921v02/pg663"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.51/173: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gonzales</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Lima</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-05-04T11:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 4, 1921—11
                                a.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 12:55 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>35. My 26, April 7, 6 p.m.<anchor n="4" xml:id="d611-f1"/> Rumor in banking
                    circles that gold reserve fund in New York to be transferred to London and
                    through that transaction cause drafts for profit of £600,000 sterling be thrown
                    on this market, has caused advance 30 points in Peruvian pounds. Am seeing
                    President at noon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
